{"path":"utility/stacktrace_entry/to_string","title":"std::to_string","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::</span>to_string","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/utility/stacktrace_entry/to_string","section":"utility","kind":"page","summary":"Returns a string with a description of f.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td> <div>Defined in header <code><a href=\"/w/cpp/header/stacktrace\">&lt;stacktrace&gt;</a></code>\n </div></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx23\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/string/basic_string\"><span class=\"kw1238\">std::<span class=\"me2\">string</span></span></a> to_string<span class=\"br0\">(</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/stacktrace_entry\"><span class=\"kw3633\">std::<span class=\"me2\">stacktrace_entry</span></span></a><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> f <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx23\">(since C++23)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Returns a string with a description of <code>f</code>.\n</p><p>The standard recommends that the description should provide information about the contained evaluation, including information from <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">f.<span class=\"me1\">source_file</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code> and <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">f.<span class=\"me1\">source_line</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td>  f\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td>  a <code>stacktrace_entry</code> whose description is to be returned\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p>A string with a description of <code>f</code>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Exceptions\">Exceptions</h3>\n<p>May throw implementation-defined exceptions. \n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Notes\">Notes</h3>\n<p>Custom allocators support for this function is not provided, because the implementations usually require platform specific allocations, system calls and a lot of CPU intensive work, while a custom allocator does not provide benefits for this function as the platform specific operations take an order of magnitude more time than the allocation.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;stacktrace&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;string&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"kw4\">auto</span> st <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">stacktrace</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">current</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span>\n        <span class=\"st0\">\"Description of an empty stacktrace entry:<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>\"</span> <span class=\"sy2\">+</span>\n        <a href=\"/w/cpp/string/basic_string/to_string\"><span class=\"kw1273\">std::<span class=\"me2\">to_string</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/stacktrace_entry\"><span class=\"kw3633\">std::<span class=\"me2\">stacktrace_entry</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"kw1\">if</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span>st.<span class=\"me1\">size</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"nu0\">0</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n        <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span>\n            <span class=\"st0\">\"Description of a non-empty stacktrace entry:<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>\"</span> <span class=\"sy2\">+</span>\n            <a href=\"/w/cpp/string/basic_string/to_string\"><span class=\"kw1273\">std::<span class=\"me2\">to_string</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>st<span class=\"br0\">[</span><span class=\"nu0\">0</span><span class=\"br0\">]</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"br0\">}</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Possible output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>Description of an empty stacktrace entry:\n&nbsp;\nDescription of a non-empty stacktrace entry:\n0x0000000000402DE9 in ./prog.exe</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/basic_stacktrace/to_string\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>to_string</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx23\">(C++23)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  returns a string with a description of the <code>basic_stacktrace</code> <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function template)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Exceptions","id":"Exceptions"},{"depth":3,"text":"Notes","id":"Notes"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"utility","title":"Utility library"},{"path":"utility/stacktrace_entry","title":"std::stacktrace_entry"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::to_string","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration; revisions: since C++23. Returns a string with a description of f."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"f"},{"label":"Return value","note":"A string with a description of f."},{"label":"Exceptions","note":"May throw implementation-defined exceptions."},{"label":"Notes","note":"Custom allocators support for this function is not provided, because the implementations usually require platform specific allocations, system calls and a lot…"},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"to_string","note":"returns a string with a description of the basic_stacktrace"}]}]},"standards":["C++23"],"wordCount":193,"codeBlockCount":2}
